## 1. cost — benchmarks/sec10/ready_perf.py (open-model aiohttp generator in its own OS process; 100 rps /health/ready for 15s + 10 rps /api/system/status side load)
# live-local cases go through a loopback COUNTING PROXY (Python ThreadingHTTPServer) in front of PostgREST — it adds per-probe latency, so live-local probe latencies here are an UPPER bound of the check's own cost
